{"t":"TRI","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Thomson Reuters Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","employees":27100,"hq":"Toronto, ON, Canada","website":"https://www.thomsonreuters.com","summary_en":"Thomson Reuters Corporation operates as a content and technology company in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through five segments: Legal Professionals, Corporates, Tax, Audit & Accounting Professionals, Reuters News, and Global Print. The Legal Professionals segment offers research and workflow products focusing on legal research and integrated legal workflow solutions that combine content, tools, and analytics to law firms and governments. The Corporates segment provides a suite of content-driven technologies, including generative AI and integrated compliance workflow solutions to small businesses and multinational organizations. Tax, Audit & Accounting Professionals segment offers research and workflow products to tax, audit, and accounting firms. The Reuters News segment provides business, financial, and international news to media organizations, professional, and news consumers through Reuters News Agency, Reuters.com, Reuters Events, Thomson Reuters products, and to financial firms. The Global Print segment offers legal and tax information primarily in print format. The company was formerly known as The Thomson Corporation and changed its name to Thomson Reuters Corporation in April 2008. The company was founded in 1799 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada. Thomson Reuters Corporation is a subsidiary of The Woodbridge Company Limited.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Thomson Reuters Corporation은 미주, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역에서 콘텐츠 및 기술 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 법률 전문가, 기업, 세무, 감사 및 회계 전문가, 로이터 뉴스, 글로벌 인쇄 등 5개 부문으로 운영됩니다. 법률 전문가 부문은 법률 연구에 초점을 맞춘 연구 및 워크플로 제품과 법률 회사 및 정부에 대한 콘텐츠, 도구 및 분석을 결합하는 통합 법률 워크플로 솔루션을 제공합니다. 기업 부문은 중소기업 및 다국적 조직에 생성 AI 및 통합 규정 준수 워크플로 솔루션을 포함한 콘텐츠 기반 기술 제품군을 제공합니다. 세금, 감사 및 회계 전문가 부문은 세금, 감사 및 회계 회사에 연구 및 워크플로우 제품을 제공합니다. 로이터 뉴스 부문은 로이터 통신사, Reuters.com, 로이터 이벤트, 톰슨 로이터 제품 및 금융 회사를 통해 미디어 조직, 전문가 및 뉴스 소비자에게 비즈니스, 금융 및 국제 뉴스를 제공합니다. 글로벌 인쇄 부문은 주로 인쇄 형식으로 법률 및 세금 정보를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 The Thomson Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2008년 4월에 Thomson Reuters Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1799년에 설립되었으며 캐나다 토론토에 본사를 두고 있습니다. Thomson Reuters Corporation은 The Woodbridge Company Limited의 자회사입니다.","val":{"price":108.9,"mcap":47203672064.0,"pe":33.404907,"fpe":23.138311,"peg":1.5888,"ps":5.890151,"pb":4.205608,"ev_ebitda":21.143,"div":2.41,"beta":0.188,"hi52":142.04,"lo52":76.28},"fin":{"rev":8014000128.0,"rev_g":0.106,"eps_g":-0.187,"gross":0.39743,"op":0.27577,"net":0.19691,"roe":0.14114,"fcf":1178000000.0,"cash":1528999936.0,"debt":4148000000.0,"de":36.957,"eps":3.26,"feps":4.70648},"own":{"short":null,"inst":0.28414,"insider":0.71031},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":128.42308,"median":130.0,"high":146.0,"low":112.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.78947,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":9,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":115.0,"priorPriceTarget":110.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":130.0,"priorPriceTarget":124.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":130.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action